WEBVTT

00:05:58.313 --> 00:06:03.203
♫ I mean, you're not even really naked. ♫

00:06:03.203 --> 00:06:06.546
♫ And I'm the one with the problem. ♫

00:06:06.546 --> 00:06:13.814
♫ And you tell me, don't worry 
so much, you'll be great. ♫

00:06:13.814 --> 00:06:16.618
♫ But I'm the one living with me ♫

00:06:16.618 --> 00:06:18.936
♫ and I know how I get. ♫

00:06:18.936 --> 00:06:23.080
♫ Your advice is gentle but late. ♫

00:06:23.080 --> 00:06:26.529
♫ If not just a bit patronizing. ♫

00:06:26.529 --> 00:06:31.361
♫ And that sarcastic tone doesn't 
help me when I sing. ♫